@startuml Feature3_Class
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 13
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 80
skinparam ranksep 80
hide circle

title **Feature 3: Hiring Proposal & Director Approval (Class Diagram)**

note as N1
  Replaces the former "Candidate Schedule Booking" feature,
  dropped 15/08/2026 together with the shared slot pool.
  New rule from the defence panel: the department manager
  only RECOMMENDS; the director decides and sets the terms.
end note

class HiringProposalController <<boundary>> {
    - _proposalService : HiringProposalService
    + CreateAsync(applicationId : long, dto : Object) : Object
    + DecideAsync(proposalId : long, dto : Object) : Object
    + GetListAsync(status : string) : Object
}

class HiringProposalService <<control>> {
    - _proposalRepo : HiringProposalRepository
    - _appRepo : ApplicationRepository
    - _jobRepo : JobRepository
    - _stateService : ApplicationStateService
    + CreateAsync(companyId : long, userId : long, applicationId : long, dto : Object) : HiringProposalDto
    + DecideAsync(companyId : long, userId : long, proposalId : long, dto : Object) : HiringProposalDto
    + GetListAsync(companyId : long, status : string) : List<HiringProposalDto>
}

class HiringProposal <<entity>> {
    - proposalId : long
    - applicationId : long
    - status : string
    - proposalNote : string
    - proposedSalary : decimal
    - proposedStartDate : DateTime
    - approvedSalary : decimal
    - approvedStartDate : DateTime
    - createdBy : long
    - decidedBy : long
}

class Application <<entity>> {
    - applicationId : long
    - jobId : long
    - candidateId : long
    - currentState : string
}

class OfferDetail <<entity>> {
    - offerId : long
    - applicationId : long
    - salaryAmount : decimal
    - startDate : DateTime
    - status : string
}

HiringProposalController --> HiringProposalService : Association
HiringProposalService --> HiringProposal : Dependency
Application "1" *--> "*" HiringProposal : Composition
HiringProposal ..> OfferDetail : approved terms feed the offer letter

@enduml
